You should exercise extreme caution.
Unless you're playing a Valk (and somewhat even then) nethack is not a
quickly hack and slash your way to victory kind of game.  It is more a
puzzle and thinking game.

Once past the Mines and Soko, these are my goals:
1) Good artifact weapon
2) Natural AC: 0 or lower
3) Fill out the AK
4) Acquire Teleport Control and Teleoportitus
5) Do the Quest
6) Make holy water
7) Enchant weapon
8) Enchant armor
9) Double check the AK and then wake the wizard and win.

Rarely do I accomplish them in that order (except that #9 is always
last).  Usually i end up stopping before Medusa and doing a partial
enchantment my armor and weapons.  I usually don't find that last
piece of the AK until just before I wake the Wizard.

When I first started, I rarely went below Medusa without a full AK.
Now as long as i have reflection, magic resistance, the highest
possible magic cancellation, and AC:-20 or better I'll go all the way
down and find the VIBSQ.

To me post mines&soko is actually the easy part.  How one gets past
them is the actual hard part.  Since you're safely getting past those
two, I'd say just keep at it.  It is only a matter of time before you
ascend.

Good luck and hope to see your YAAP soon.


